WEBVTT

00:00:05.435 --> 00:00:08.336
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.039 --> 00:00:11.909
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.909 --> 00:00:13.968
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.811 --> 00:00:18.941
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.517 --> 00:00:23.353
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.353 --> 00:00:25.480
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.256 --> 00:00:30.283
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:31.995 --> 00:00:34.765
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.765 --> 00:00:37.393
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.668 --> 00:00:41.263
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.706 --> 00:00:47.370
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.378 --> 00:00:49.880
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.077
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.918 --> 00:00:57.087
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.087 --> 00:01:01.148
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.391 --> 00:01:06.021
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:09.288
Let's go!

00:01:12.602 --> 00:01:16.003
LIFE IS SHORT,
SO GIRLS SHOULD KILL

00:01:19.376 --> 00:01:22.436
Assassinate him? Tylor?

00:01:22.879 --> 00:01:23.868
Is it too difficult?

00:01:24.014 --> 00:01:28.041
No, sir. But isn't my mission
to gather intelligence?

00:01:28.151 --> 00:01:31.588
Intelligence gathering is the
covert discovery of an enemy's...

00:01:31.588 --> 00:01:35.115
...movements or plans for
report to friendly forces.

00:01:35.459 --> 00:01:39.395
But unless you know whether your
enemy is worth investigating...

00:01:39.463 --> 00:01:41.431
...the intelligence you
get from him is meaningless.

00:01:42.232 --> 00:01:45.395
In other words,
if he can't defend himself...

00:01:45.469 --> 00:01:47.528
...he isn't worth investigating?

00:01:47.971 --> 00:01:50.633
Show no mercy.
Just kill Captain Tylor!

00:01:51.775 --> 00:01:52.935
As you wish, sir.

00:01:53.810 --> 00:01:57.610
Huh? Point KM-40
in the Kowloon Nebula?

00:01:57.814 --> 00:02:01.409
Yes. Gas particles are preventing
us from getting a clear picture...

00:02:01.485 --> 00:02:04.215
...but it looks like
there's an enemy fleet there.

00:02:04.488 --> 00:02:07.048
Since we can't confirm its size,
we need you to do a recon.

00:02:07.491 --> 00:02:09.618
Do you mind being given
such a trivial task?

00:02:09.693 --> 00:02:13.459
No, sir. I'm ready
to do this any time.

00:02:13.830 --> 00:02:17.701
Justy Ueki Tylor lives to bring
peace and love to the universe!

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:21.762
Well, I'm sure I don't need to
tell a smart man like you this...

00:02:21.838 --> 00:02:25.535
...but donвЂ™t just warp in there
and give yourself away.

00:02:25.809 --> 00:02:27.470
Right, sir.
Just leave everything to me!

00:02:29.980 --> 00:02:33.279
You sure you want him
to go there so slowly?

00:02:33.517 --> 00:02:36.509
We could settle this faster
if he'd just warp in.

00:02:37.521 --> 00:02:40.615
He has the devil's
own luck with warps.

00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:44.958
And you want that luck
gone from your life.

00:02:45.429 --> 00:02:48.592
That's why I contacted you
and paid so much money.

00:02:48.698 --> 00:02:49.960
I want Tylor dead!

00:02:50.033 --> 00:02:52.968
Dead and buried,
with nothing left behind!

00:03:22.899 --> 00:03:23.558
There he is.

00:03:44.421 --> 00:03:48.152
Damn it! What are you doing,
First Officer Tylor?!

00:03:49.593 --> 00:03:53.029
I've suffered your
foolishness for the last time!

00:03:53.263 --> 00:03:56.562
I'll have you shot!
No, I'll have you hung!

00:03:59.936 --> 00:04:03.929
Mmm, that's definitely the
best way to relieve stress.

00:04:07.611 --> 00:04:09.169
But it feels so empty...

00:04:20.624 --> 00:04:23.024
Damn it,
I feel jumpy tonight!

00:04:24.261 --> 00:04:28.129
Hey! Tylor!
Wanna drink with me?!

00:04:29.633 --> 00:04:31.897
Huh? Not in?

00:04:31.968 --> 00:04:35.165
If the Raalgon attacked now,
we'd all be dead!

00:04:47.350 --> 00:04:50.513
Sorry, but you can count
me out of this one.

00:04:50.587 --> 00:04:51.417
We can't win.

00:04:51.855 --> 00:04:57.088
Right. Even if we swung it,
we'd need to get it organized.

00:04:59.296 --> 00:05:02.925
Yuriko and Yamamoto'll
be the first to object.

00:05:03.099 --> 00:05:05.897
Even if we shut Yamamoto's mouth...

00:05:05.969 --> 00:05:09.632
Yeah. Yuriko will get
the others to object.

00:05:15.011 --> 00:05:15.978
Who's there?!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:21.617
Harumi?!

00:05:21.785 --> 00:05:23.082
What's goin' on?

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:25.248
I, uh!

00:05:26.289 --> 00:05:28.052
You God damned idiot!

00:05:29.292 --> 00:05:31.351
Boy, you really surprised us!

00:05:31.695 --> 00:05:34.698
But what are
you doing down here?

00:05:34.698 --> 00:05:36.256
And dressed like that?

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:39.201
Oh, I know.
You're jogging, right?

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.868
Uh, ah, yes! I've been
thinking of going on a diet.

00:05:45.342 --> 00:05:48.937
Thought so. But you really
shouldn't come here.

00:05:49.312 --> 00:05:51.371
There's so much junk lying
around that it's dangerous.

00:05:52.048 --> 00:05:53.845
You're right. I'm sorry, sir.

00:05:54.351 --> 00:05:56.785
Sorry I interrupted
such an important meeting.

00:05:58.388 --> 00:06:00.720
Are you working on
a new operation, sir?

00:06:04.060 --> 00:06:06.187
Operation? That's a good one!

00:06:07.063 --> 00:06:08.189
Am I wrong?

00:06:09.065 --> 00:06:11.590
No, it's not that.
It's just a contest...

00:06:13.036 --> 00:06:15.971
Contest? What contest?

00:06:16.072 --> 00:06:17.664
Uh, it's nothing!

00:06:17.741 --> 00:06:21.677
We were just discussing who the
best woman on the Soyokaze was...

00:06:21.745 --> 00:06:23.235
...and got carried away.

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:26.571
You want to participate, Harumi?

00:06:27.751 --> 00:06:29.776
It... It sounds like fun.

00:06:31.755 --> 00:06:35.088
May I be in the contest, too?

00:06:35.325 --> 00:06:36.622
All right!

00:06:38.094 --> 00:06:39.686
You've got to be kidding!

00:06:40.030 --> 00:06:43.295
What kind of military vessel
has a beauty contest?!

00:06:43.366 --> 00:06:46.995
C'mon, if we don't relax once in a
while, the stress will get to us!

00:06:47.103 --> 00:06:48.832
It'll cause MORE stress!

00:06:49.105 --> 00:06:50.538
What about you, Mr. Yamamoto?

00:06:50.807 --> 00:06:52.274
I'm against it, of course!

00:06:52.342 --> 00:06:55.038
Oh, really?
Well, I don't blame you.

00:06:55.111 --> 00:06:58.308
I was going to have you be acting
captain while it was going on...

00:06:58.381 --> 00:06:59.746
...but I guess that'd be
too much trouble for you.

00:07:00.417 --> 00:07:02.942
Acting captain? Me?

00:07:03.119 --> 00:07:04.245
Who else would I get?

00:07:05.722 --> 00:07:07.849
Yes, that's right...

00:07:09.426 --> 00:07:12.452
Well, in that case,
how can I say no?

00:07:12.762 --> 00:07:15.060
Very well! I accept your offer!

00:07:16.132 --> 00:07:17.793
I'll be in it, too.

00:07:19.135 --> 00:07:22.366
Well, it'll give me a chance
to wear something different.

00:07:22.439 --> 00:07:24.168
I'm so sick of this uniform!

00:07:24.407 --> 00:07:25.675
A contest?!

00:07:25.675 --> 00:07:26.801
Sure we will!

00:07:28.378 --> 00:07:29.675
Yes, I'd love to.

00:07:30.814 --> 00:07:31.678
It's on!

00:07:44.127 --> 00:07:46.357
We don't need that, you idiot!

00:07:48.998 --> 00:07:52.434
Guys! Come to me if
any of you gets hurt.

00:07:54.471 --> 00:07:56.098
More to the left. Yeah.

00:07:56.172 --> 00:08:00.609
Andressen! Why, you!
You threw my Ranpu out of here!

00:08:01.177 --> 00:08:02.542
Tell it to the captain.

00:08:02.645 --> 00:08:03.546
What?!

00:08:03.546 --> 00:08:04.604
Hey! Kojiro!

00:08:05.482 --> 00:08:07.780
Quit bellyaching
and give us a hand!

00:08:07.984 --> 00:08:08.609
Well?

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:14.513
Darn it! Stupid
beauty contest... Idiots!

00:08:15.458 --> 00:08:17.688
Wow!
It's really coming together!

00:08:19.496 --> 00:08:21.054
Everyone's doing a great job!

00:08:21.865 --> 00:08:25.392
If you ever leave the service,
you could turn professional.

00:08:25.869 --> 00:08:28.133
Work is work, fun is fun!

00:08:28.338 --> 00:08:30.602
That's how professional
soldiers think!

00:08:30.874 --> 00:08:32.034
I see...

00:08:32.442 --> 00:08:33.238
Captain!

00:08:34.177 --> 00:08:37.078
Harumi! What's up?
You here to watch, too?

00:08:37.180 --> 00:08:41.014
No, sir. I'm on duty,
in case anyone gets hurt.

00:08:41.518 --> 00:08:43.383
You're incredible, Harumi!

00:08:43.486 --> 00:08:45.477
Oh, no.
Just part of the job.

00:08:45.889 --> 00:08:50.451
By the way, Captain, there's
a swimsuit competition, right?

00:08:50.527 --> 00:08:51.721
Yeah, of course.

00:08:51.895 --> 00:08:55.831
Then I have a problem.
I don't have a suit.

00:08:55.965 --> 00:08:57.660
Oh? That is a problem.

00:08:59.169 --> 00:09:01.501
I know! You could
borrow one from Yuriko!

00:09:02.138 --> 00:09:02.472
Hey, Yuriko...

00:09:02.472 --> 00:09:03.339
Uh, Captain!
Hey, Yuriko...

00:09:03.339 --> 00:09:04.040
Uh, Captain!

00:09:04.040 --> 00:09:04.699
What?

00:09:05.542 --> 00:09:09.171
This is a little embarrassing.
Maybe later?

00:09:09.245 --> 00:09:11.213
Oh, right. Sorry, sorry.

00:09:15.251 --> 00:09:17.412
Laugh while you can!

00:09:17.921 --> 00:09:19.320
Oh, dear!

00:09:19.622 --> 00:09:20.384
What's wrong?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:22.759
I forgot. It's time for
me to make another round.

00:09:22.759 --> 00:09:23.593
Right, right.

00:09:23.593 --> 00:09:25.462
Well, if you'll excuse me.

00:09:25.462 --> 00:09:26.759
Right! Dismissed!

00:09:32.936 --> 00:09:34.426
Harumi, you forgot...

00:09:42.212 --> 00:09:43.179
She's gone.

00:09:48.852 --> 00:09:50.251
Captain!

00:09:52.922 --> 00:09:55.254
Farewell, Captain Tylor.

00:10:14.544 --> 00:10:15.636
What the?

00:10:16.145 --> 00:10:16.839
Tylor!

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:18.374
Hey!

00:10:23.987 --> 00:10:25.545
Now THAT was close!

00:10:25.989 --> 00:10:27.422
Yeah. Nice work.

00:10:28.324 --> 00:10:31.122
Except you nearly gave
me a third nostril.

00:10:31.327 --> 00:10:32.351
Captain!

00:10:32.996 --> 00:10:34.054
Are you all right, sir?

00:10:34.264 --> 00:10:35.663
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:10:36.599 --> 00:10:40.057
Really? Thank goodness.

00:10:40.537 --> 00:10:45.065
Wow, it's great to know you
worry about me so much, Harumi.

00:10:51.748 --> 00:10:52.305
Here.

00:10:52.982 --> 00:10:54.415
This is my...

00:10:55.018 --> 00:10:56.679
Captain, you were trying
to give this to me?

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:00.387
Oh, I just found it.
But you need it, right?

00:11:00.623 --> 00:11:01.419
Yes...

00:11:03.293 --> 00:11:04.521
Thank you very much, sir.

00:11:04.594 --> 00:11:06.061
Oh, it's nothing.

00:11:06.362 --> 00:11:10.300
Well, I'd better treat you with it.
Now, take off your coat...

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:11.164
Uh, sure.

00:11:11.367 --> 00:11:11.890
Ow!

00:11:13.803 --> 00:11:15.305
Uh-oh! You're hurt!

00:11:15.305 --> 00:11:17.330
No, it's just a little cut.

00:11:18.041 --> 00:11:19.030
What are you saying?

00:11:19.342 --> 00:11:21.367
You don't want it to
get infected, do you?

00:11:21.611 --> 00:11:22.805
Come on, let's see it.

00:11:23.613 --> 00:11:24.307
Yes, sir.

00:11:26.382 --> 00:11:27.906
Damn it! Wish I was him!

00:11:27.984 --> 00:11:29.383
Yeah, the lucky SOB!

00:11:33.389 --> 00:11:35.016
Okay, all finished.

00:11:38.061 --> 00:11:39.551
Thank you very much.

00:11:39.729 --> 00:11:43.893
My pleasure. Anyway,
it's lucky no one was hurt.

00:11:44.067 --> 00:11:44.692
Right?

00:11:44.767 --> 00:11:45.791
I guess.

00:11:46.069 --> 00:11:49.835
The thing is, that scaffold
was built solid as a rock.

00:11:50.073 --> 00:11:52.439
Yeah. I don't think
it was an accident.

00:11:54.043 --> 00:11:55.305
Jason! Was it you?!

00:11:57.914 --> 00:11:59.711
If it wasn't him, then...

00:12:00.083 --> 00:12:03.575
The problem is that there are
too many people with a motive.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:04.445
Yeah.

00:12:04.687 --> 00:12:06.484
Do a good job, everyone!

00:12:06.723 --> 00:12:09.283
Remember, work is work
and fun is fun!

00:12:09.726 --> 00:12:10.249
Right?

00:12:11.928 --> 00:12:14.954
Oh, yes. Never mind me.
I have to check you, Captain.

00:12:16.466 --> 00:12:19.833
Since I can't do a real exam here,
let's go to the sick bay.

00:12:20.336 --> 00:12:23.406
I want to do a full check,
just to be safe. Come on.

00:12:23.406 --> 00:12:24.134
But...

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:25.805
In return for
bandaging my finger.

00:12:26.442 --> 00:12:27.568
Uh, sure.

00:12:33.016 --> 00:12:35.985
Huh? What's this doing here?

00:12:47.130 --> 00:12:48.859
Isn't this overdoing things?

00:12:49.132 --> 00:12:52.397
Oh, no. It's my duty to
keep you healthy, Captain.

00:12:52.468 --> 00:12:55.437
Oh. I'm glad
to hear that, but...

00:12:58.775 --> 00:13:00.333
Oh, this is bad!

00:13:01.144 --> 00:13:02.941
Your body readings
are totally abnormal!

00:13:03.613 --> 00:13:05.137
If I don't give
you a stabilizer!

00:13:05.648 --> 00:13:07.582
This should put you
out of your misery...

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:08.480
Hey, wait!

00:13:09.152 --> 00:13:12.121
The way I read it,
there's nothing wrong.

00:13:13.089 --> 00:13:16.786
Oh, my! You're right!
My mistake. Sorry.

00:13:17.727 --> 00:13:20.924
Captain, why don't I make you
some coffee? As an apology.

00:13:21.130 --> 00:13:23.963
Oh, sure.
Let me get dressed first.

00:13:24.133 --> 00:13:24.758
Right.

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:30.537
He's a slippery one!
Fine! I'll show him!

00:13:34.477 --> 00:13:36.775
You know, even if the rooms
themselves are the same...

00:13:36.846 --> 00:13:38.677
...girls' rooms always
seem so different.

00:13:38.748 --> 00:13:42.445
You think so?
Oh, Captain. Sugar?

00:13:42.518 --> 00:13:44.452
Yes, please.

00:13:44.520 --> 00:13:45.817
Okay.

00:13:50.126 --> 00:13:50.785
There you go.

00:13:51.527 --> 00:13:52.391
Thanks.

00:13:53.496 --> 00:13:56.693
Oh, this is cute!
I've never seen this brand.

00:13:59.001 --> 00:14:00.127
Here, Harumi.
You have some first.

00:14:00.203 --> 00:14:03.104
Uh, no thanks!
I take it black.

00:14:03.206 --> 00:14:06.175
Oh, okay. Fine, I'll take it.

00:14:06.809 --> 00:14:07.798
Oh, yeah!

00:14:08.177 --> 00:14:08.768
Yes?!

00:14:08.945 --> 00:14:13.075
If you want a swimsuit,
I can ask Yuriko for you...

00:14:13.216 --> 00:14:14.478
Uh, is something wrong?

00:14:14.784 --> 00:14:15.842
The sugar...

00:14:16.552 --> 00:14:19.680
I mean, your coffee's
getting cold!

00:14:19.756 --> 00:14:20.882
Oh, you're right.

00:14:23.059 --> 00:14:23.923
Harumi?

00:14:24.060 --> 00:14:26.153
Yes?! Now what?!

00:14:26.562 --> 00:14:29.156
What's wrong?
You don't look well.

00:14:29.232 --> 00:14:31.700
Uh, well, that is...

00:14:32.235 --> 00:14:36.695
Oh, it's probably because I've
never had a man in my room before.

00:14:37.206 --> 00:14:39.538
Oh, is that why? Sorry.

00:14:42.578 --> 00:14:44.375
Sorry.
Can I have another one?

00:14:46.582 --> 00:14:48.812
No, that was the last of it.

00:14:48.951 --> 00:14:51.545
Oh. Oh, well, guess
I'll have it black, too!

00:14:56.859 --> 00:14:59.487
Lieutenant? Lieutenant Yamamoto?

00:15:00.897 --> 00:15:02.125
Oh, for crying out loud...

00:15:03.266 --> 00:15:05.063
Acting Captain Yamamoto?

00:15:06.202 --> 00:15:09.603
Yes? You called,
Chief Helmsman Katori?

00:15:10.573 --> 00:15:13.440
We're sailing on course
for point KM-40...

00:15:13.943 --> 00:15:15.808
...in the Kowloon Nebula,
as scheduled, sir.

00:15:15.978 --> 00:15:17.172
I see. Well done.

00:15:17.613 --> 00:15:21.014
Well, I have to get
ready for the contest.

00:15:21.284 --> 00:15:22.273
Hold down the fort.

00:15:23.619 --> 00:15:26.588
So, I'll be the only one
left on the bridge, huh?

00:15:26.789 --> 00:15:29.781
Can't be helped. Captain's orders.

00:15:30.092 --> 00:15:34.688
I finally get to be acting captain
and it's just a house-sitting job!

00:15:36.632 --> 00:15:38.259
Damn you, Tylor!

00:15:48.644 --> 00:15:50.134
I won't be fooled!

00:15:51.948 --> 00:15:52.812
Who's there?

00:15:52.949 --> 00:15:53.938
It's Yuriko.

00:15:54.851 --> 00:15:58.685
The captain asked
me to bring you this.

00:15:59.288 --> 00:16:00.050
For me?

00:16:00.323 --> 00:16:02.553
He said you didn't
have a swimsuit.

00:16:03.192 --> 00:16:06.252
Oh, it's adorable!
You're sure this is all right?

00:16:06.329 --> 00:16:08.231
Of course.
It's mine, after all.

00:16:08.231 --> 00:16:10.756
I'm just not sure if it'll fit.

00:16:10.833 --> 00:16:12.164
What about you, Yuriko?

00:16:12.668 --> 00:16:17.264
Oh, don't worry. I'll be fine.
Hope it looks good on you.

00:16:17.373 --> 00:16:18.271
Yuriko?

00:16:18.641 --> 00:16:19.375
If you'll excuse me.

00:16:19.375 --> 00:16:20.205
Uh, sure.

00:16:22.678 --> 00:16:24.168
Thank you very much.

00:16:58.347 --> 00:16:59.939
Huh? Harumi?

00:17:05.721 --> 00:17:07.245
Oh, you found them.

00:17:07.657 --> 00:17:11.149
I wash and wash,
but never seem to catch up.

00:17:12.662 --> 00:17:13.788
You're making a fool of me!

00:17:16.999 --> 00:17:18.466
Whoa! Wait! Hold it!

00:17:24.373 --> 00:17:26.136
Harumi, are you okay?

00:17:27.410 --> 00:17:28.377
Damn you!

00:17:37.987 --> 00:17:41.582
Okay...
So, I was right about you.

00:17:42.291 --> 00:17:43.121
Right about me?

00:17:43.426 --> 00:17:46.259
Yeah. Roses have
thorns, don't they?

00:17:46.762 --> 00:17:47.990
I give you credit.

00:17:48.431 --> 00:17:52.401
You pretended all along that
you didn't know I was a spy.

00:17:52.401 --> 00:17:54.392
Oh, no! Not at all.

00:17:55.371 --> 00:17:56.702
When did you realize it?

00:17:56.806 --> 00:18:00.298
Well, you were always
acting so mysterious.

00:18:00.776 --> 00:18:04.940
So I thought it'd be cool if
you were a spy or something.

00:18:05.081 --> 00:18:06.105
You mean!

00:18:08.017 --> 00:18:13.546
Well, as you can see, I'm a Raalgon
spy who was sent to kill you.

00:18:15.391 --> 00:18:18.121
Whoa! Hold it! Calm down!

00:18:18.461 --> 00:18:21.294
If you're set on killing
yourself, I won't stop you.

00:18:21.464 --> 00:18:25.992
But do Raalgon usually commit
suicide when a job's half finished?

00:18:27.403 --> 00:18:30.600
Spies always kill themselves
when their cover is blown!

00:18:31.340 --> 00:18:32.807
And who knows about you?!

00:18:33.776 --> 00:18:36.904
If I don't tell anyone,
then no one will know!

00:18:37.913 --> 00:18:38.675
Tylor...

00:18:39.048 --> 00:18:43.382
Oh, wait. If you don't do your
job, they'll get mad at you.

00:18:43.586 --> 00:18:44.644
I'd be killed.

00:18:46.088 --> 00:18:47.248
Then how about this?

00:18:47.823 --> 00:18:50.690
Say I've been totally
taken in by you...

00:18:50.826 --> 00:18:55.490
...and you need more time to
get some good info from me.

00:18:55.831 --> 00:18:57.196
Lie to my own people?

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:59.634
Don't take it so seriously!

00:19:00.136 --> 00:19:02.764
As long as you give them some
decent info, it'll be fine, right?

00:19:03.506 --> 00:19:07.670
But you're the captain of
the Soyokaze, a UPSF ship!

00:19:08.044 --> 00:19:11.445
Look, we're just on a
routine recon mission.

00:19:11.647 --> 00:19:14.741
It's to point KM-40
in the Kowloon Nebula.

00:19:16.052 --> 00:19:16.882
Tylor...

00:19:47.550 --> 00:19:49.643
Someone's warping out!

00:19:50.186 --> 00:19:51.847
The destroyer Soyokaze?

00:19:54.490 --> 00:19:56.549
No! It's a Raalgon fleet!

00:19:57.193 --> 00:19:58.160
A WHAT?!

00:19:59.228 --> 00:20:02.356
What?! Why?! WHY?!

00:20:08.404 --> 00:20:11.339
New class of enemy vessel
holding at point KM-40...

00:20:11.407 --> 00:20:13.841
...of the Kowloon Nebula has been
engaged and destroyed, Captain.

00:20:15.177 --> 00:20:18.203
I see.
The intelligence was correct.

00:20:18.714 --> 00:20:20.841
What orders do you wish
to give Harumi, sir?

00:20:21.150 --> 00:20:23.175
If she couldn't assassinate him...

00:20:23.252 --> 00:20:25.812
...then this man Tylor really
is worth keeping an eye on.

00:20:26.255 --> 00:20:30.715
Now that we know that, have her
continue to observe the situation.

00:20:32.261 --> 00:20:33.353
What do you mean?!

00:20:33.896 --> 00:20:36.228
You didn't follow
my orders, did you?!

00:20:36.565 --> 00:20:39.557
No, sir!
I, Acting Captain Yamamoto...

00:20:39.635 --> 00:20:44.163
...have carried out our
mission and am ready to report!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:49.209
There's no sign of an enemy fleet at
point KM-40 in the Kowloon Nebula!

00:20:49.278 --> 00:20:50.905
That's not possible!

00:20:51.313 --> 00:20:53.110
No, it's definitely true, sir.

00:20:53.249 --> 00:20:57.845
All we've found here is the
wreckage of an unidentified ship.

00:20:58.587 --> 00:21:00.077
Wreckage?

00:21:00.156 --> 00:21:02.590
Yes, sir. Shall we
investigate this further?

00:21:03.292 --> 00:21:05.726
Never mind!
Just return at once!

00:21:05.961 --> 00:21:07.292
Aye, sir! Right away!

00:21:07.663 --> 00:21:10.757
Acting Captain Yamamoto,
over and out!

00:21:12.368 --> 00:21:17.203
The First Annual
Miss Soyokaze Contest

00:21:32.821 --> 00:21:35.847
Sorry.
It didn't really fit, so...

00:21:36.325 --> 00:21:38.657
It's okay.
I really don't mind.

00:21:38.727 --> 00:21:39.887
Harumi!

00:21:40.596 --> 00:21:42.063
Here! Over here!

00:21:42.965 --> 00:21:45.763
I'm rooting for you!
Good luck!

00:21:45.935 --> 00:21:49.132
Hey! The chief judge isn't
supposed to say stuff like that!

00:21:49.672 --> 00:21:51.105
Oh, just relax.

00:21:53.008 --> 00:21:56.034
Justy Ueki Tylor...
Such a strange person.

00:22:12.795 --> 00:22:13.819
The Irresponsible Captain Tylor
Next Episode

00:22:16.165 --> 00:22:19.001
A tea stalk floating upright is
lucky, but doesn't tell the future.

00:22:19.001 --> 00:22:22.061
With demotion close at hand,
what will be the Soyokaze's fate?

00:22:22.504 --> 00:22:25.132
Next time, "When You
Wish Upon a Flower."

00:22:25.307 --> 00:22:25.708
Watch for it.

00:22:25.708 --> 00:22:26.275
Filming is Job 1!
Working hard for those who demand
the finest in image and sound
Watch for it.

